  "historical_output_text": " A morning spent on the phone can turn up a treasure in an unexpected nookie.\nTitle:\nIn Praise: My Phone\r\n\r\nAs my morning began and my hand reached to answer a routine voice from an unknown contact - \"Hello there\", a name flashed in front of eyes. A moment's confusion followed before realization struck - an address to the very book that had long haunted but eludic existence, a treasure to which access eluded.\r\n\r\nThe discovery came as an after-effect from a call with my friend about the books we both have. She brought to light her collection - an impressive and eclectic mix - but mine was a barren land with only the barest remnants - a couple, the latest, and my most prized one of a book I wanted, a hard copy to replace the old digital edition. And it wasn't that it wasn;t available",
